`?`):** 10 cycles have no `$` figure in the log. Cycle 169 has no `CYCLE` line at all, probably because it was still running when the log was copied.\n- **Cycle 147:** the runner restarted during this cycle, so round 1 appears twice. The $37.71 comes from the only `CYCLE` line, which belongs to the second run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4157,"cache_read_input_tokens":88247,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4157},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d93673-c9d7-4f41-9877-24b5393f8857","uuid":"921583b7-de98-479a-a861-603929596b09","timestamp":"2026-10-12T12:46:54.683Z","request_id":"req_011CfxNFTNBEGhuBXz9SiPSs"}
